{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1511203-aeon-history-of-psi-orders","id":1511203,"title":"[Aeon] History of Psi Orders","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-10T02:46:35-07:00","id":1511203,"title":"[Aeon] History of Psi Orders","content":"<b>Is there somewhere canon history of Psi Orders?</b> Possible Spoliers from Setting Chapter of Aeon corebook!!!<br /> <br /> We know that Orders show themselves to world in 2106, at Aberrant attack in Sidney. However, in Norca write-up there is mentioned that del Fuego reformed ecoterrorist Norca in 2104 - with introducing of Biokinetics Psions.<br /> <br /> Question is simple - 1, <b>WHEN Proxies get their Prometus Chambers to start Orders?</b> \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> EDIT: Posts below points 2104 for Orders getting Proteus Chambers. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-10-2023, 12:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T03:42:18-07:00","id":1511207,"title":"","content":"The Orders were not started all at same time. Nor\u00e7a was a group of eco terrorists before becoming an order, the Aesculapians were around since aberrant war, etc.<br /> <br /> 2104 - Bhurano tried to cure corruption in large scale with her supertech device, end up wakening a bunch of Psiads and talents, creating a huge number of latents and unlocking the Quantakinesis aptitude, all by mistake.<br /> After that, in the same year the Proxies are selected and turned into proxies. They start working on their orders, some based on previous organizations, some creating from nothing, not on public.<br /> 2106 - after almost 2 years building the orders, the Psions show up on Sydney starport and defeat a bunch of subabies, becoming public.<br /> <br /> By the way, the secrets chapter tell all that\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T04:02:48-07:00","id":1511209,"title":"","content":"Right. (Most of?) the Psi Orders existed before 2104; but until then, they weren't <i>Psi </i>Orders; they were just international organizations. Even after the rise of the Proxies, they're still international organizations, with significant portions of their ranks filled by non-psions; I would argue a majority. The Proxies just added a new tool to their respective toolboxes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T06:30:56-07:00","id":1511216,"title":"","content":"<b>Prometheus Unbound</b> is the psi order book. All the details about their history and formation are in there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T09:16:23-07:00","id":1511233,"title":"","content":"Other major Orders event - <b><i>Upeo wa Macho</i> dissapeard in 2116</b>, to return in 2123. The reason for their mass exodus was...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">As I understand, their intel on Chromatics planed invasion of Earth circa 2123</div></div> </div> </div> yes?<br /> <br /> Final creation of Leviathan Faster Than Light ships also changed Upeo wa Macho minds?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-22-2023, 06:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-10T13:16:14-07:00","id":1511260,"title":"","content":"The reason for the exodus was Bolande noticed the other orders wanted to take the teleporters freedom away after they put down the Chibs.<br /> <br /> They returned for many reasons, specially all the dangers moving toward Earth (Chromatics that captured some of the teleporters, Coalision, Aberrants, etc)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-23T20:49:59-07:00","id":1515981,"title":"","content":"Can Psi Order in 2120s have financial or administrative problems? I think about making Luna's <b>Beaulac Clinic</b>\u200b in Wroclaw District once Aesculapian Order's initiative - but they sold it to <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics</b>\u200b 'last year'. I wonder how much really possible it is in Aeon universe? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-24T18:22:14-07:00","id":1516052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1511203-aeon-history-of-psi-orders?p=1515981#post1515981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can Psi Order in 2120s have financial or administrative problems? I think about making Luna's <b>Beaulac Clinic</b>\u200b in Wroclaw District once Aesculapian Order's initiative - but they sold it to <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics</b>\u200b 'last year'. I wonder how much really possible it is in Aeon universe? \ud83e\udd14</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't need financial problems to justify a property transfer. Maybe the Aesculapian Order moved to a newer, bigger facility and sold the old property. Maybe they never actually owned the property and the property owner raised the rent; the Aesculapians went somewhere cheaper while Huang-Marr was willing to pay a premium for the PR benefits from taking over a famous Aesculapian facility.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-27T19:56:47-07:00","id":1516408,"title":"","content":"Expanding more on <i><b>Beaulac Clinic</b></i> my idea interpretation - <i><b>What's next is my game </b><u>headcanon</u><b> I prepare for chronicle, based on Aeon 2E core and Mission Statements book.</b></i><br /> <br /> <b>Beaulac Clinic</b> in Wroclaw District of Luna is center of action in both Aeon era moduls of <b>Quantim Entaglement</b> jumpstart AND <b>Descent Into Darkness</b>.<br /> <br /> So in my idea, <i><b>Beaulac Clinic</b></i> was \u00c6sculapian Order\u2019s working Luna HQ. Build in <b>2115,</b> 2 years after <b>Port-au-Prince </b>second Earth HQ, it took many more 'bright and dangerous' minded members from Haiti, to expand field medicine on Moon. But in <b>2118</b> \u00c6sculapians got some big financial hits. Rumors say that <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics</b> took a big hit of most brightest minds of VK Order - and even some fundings of it.<br /> <br /> In <b>2119</b>, <i><b>Beaulac Clinic </b></i>was bought out from \u00c6sculapian to Huang-Marr. Technically, most of the stuff at location stayed the same - only H-M added new board oversight of place ( like <b>Dr. Jerzy Grabowski</b> ) and few new specialists from their inner structues. Few members of original <i><b>Beaulac Clinic</b></i> left under new supervisor - most stayed. <b>Emil Rochevaunt</b> was one that stayed, becoming more and more interested in one of H-M secret side projects.<br /> <br /> In <b>2120</b> we have Fall of Esperanza Space Station, so Europe centered Order as \u00c6sculapians would there have hands full on saving people from there - at least. Cutting Lunar project previous HQ of them is also logical repercussion, with VK Order so thin out already by Montressor, Switzerland and Port-au-Prince\u200b, Haiti main HQs - and now burden with helping sick or dying Europe from the Fall.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Travis L. proposed on fan Discord to simply make that Rochevaunt's actions in <i><b>Beaulac Clinic</b></i>\u200b were based on his plans to defect to <b>Huang-Marr Biotechnics</b> - and turn on the ethics of Aesculapians he is (now) member of. Or to move whole Clinic parts to Boltzman Crater.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-29-2023, 12:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}